---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const p='/equipment/04-10/';
const brochure='https://www.lpkf.com/fileadmin/mediafiles/user_upload/products/pdf/DQ/flyer_lpkf_protolaser_r4_en.pdf';
const catalog='https://www.lpkf.com/fileadmin/mediafiles/user_upload/products/pdf/DQ/DQ_Catalogue_EN.pdf';
const photo='https://www.lpkf.com/fileadmin/mediafiles/_processed_/0/9/csm_Photo_PI_2023_DQ_ProtoLaser_R4_5a4094e5ce.jpg';
const refs=[
 ['front-quarter.webp','Right-front quarter: closed sloped top, green window, blue band and small upper indicator enclosure.',brochure+'#page=1','LPKF R4 flyer 10101711-230125-EN, p. 1'],
 ['front-elevation.webp','Front elevation: exterior control relief, lower door and identification; small details are approximate.',photo,'LPKF photograph of the R4 at KIT']
];
const checks=[
 ['Chart A central printed width','4.50 mm','4.50 mm','Exact from 18 pixels'],
 ['Chart B central printed width','6.50 mm','6.50 mm','Exact from 26 pixels'],
 ['B minus A','2.00 mm','2.00 mm','Exact in the authored fixture'],
 ['Blank row 0','No printed width','No printed width','Exact'],
 ['Closed cabinet W × H × D','910 × 1,650 × 795 mm','910 × 1,650 × 795 mm','0.5 mm (geometric)']
];
---
<Layout title="ProtoLaser R4 candidate · Documentary cabinet and printed chart comparison" description="Closed illustrative LPKF ProtoLaser R4 enclosure and detached inert printed chart review. No laser or process simulation.">
 <main id="r4-exhibit">
  <p><a href="/simulations/equipment/04-10/">← Equipment record 04-10</a></p>
  <p class="series">LABORATORY EQUIPMENT / 04-10 / CANDIDATE EXHIBIT</p>
  <h1>ProtoLaser R4 candidate</h1>
  <p class="lead">Inspect the closed cabinet, then compare two fixed digital charts. The bars are ordinary, millimeter-scale printed shapes: chart A is 4.50 mm wide and chart B is 6.50 mm wide on their shared central rows. This does not represent laser-cut features or a machining result.</p>
  <div class="duo">
   <section class="card">
    <h2>Closed documentary cabinet</h2>
    <div id="r4-view" class="viewer"></div><p id="r4-model" role="status">Loading metric enclosure…</p>
    <div class="actions" aria-label="3D viewpoints">
     <button type="button" data-r4-view="orbit">Reset orbit</button><button type="button" data-r4-view="front">Front</button><button type="button" data-r4-view="side">Right flank</button><button type="button" data-r4-view="archive">Detached chart stand</button>
    </div>
    <p>Drag to orbit and scroll or pinch to zoom. Tap the detached chart screen to switch A/B. Nothing on the cabinet interacts or opens.</p>
   </section>
   <section class="card">
    <h2>Read-only printed chart comparison</h2>
    <canvas id="r4-raster" width="540" height="360" aria-label="Synthetic preprinted bar chart, sampled row and 2 mm scale."></canvas>
    <div class="inputs">
     <label>Displayed chart<select id="r4-display"><option value="0">Chart A</option><option value="1">Chart B</option></select></label>
     <label for="r4-row">Saved row <span id="r4-row-value">18</span><input id="r4-row" type="range" min="0" max="35" step="1" value="18"/></label>
    </div>
    <div class="actions"><button id="r4-next" type="button" disabled>Switch chart</button><button id="r4-empty" type="button">Show empty row</button><button id="r4-reset" type="button">Reset comparison</button><button id="r4-export" type="button" disabled>Export comparison JSON</button></div>
    <p id="r4-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading fixed printed charts…</p>
    <p id="r4-active" class="readout"></p><p id="r4-result" class="readout"></p>
   </section>
  </div>
  <section>
   <h2>Identity and reference views</h2>
   <p>The register's earlier “femtosecond” description did not match the listed R4 candidate. LPKF identifies the <strong>ProtoLaser R4</strong> as <strong>picosecond</strong> in its <a href={brochure}>flyer</a> and identifies catalog part <strong>10099642</strong> in its <a href={catalog+'#page=20'}>product catalog, p. 20</a>. This is that documented closed exterior, not a claim about a purchased device, serial number, internal generation, or factory revision. ID <strong>04-10</strong> and candidate status are unchanged.</p>
   <div class="refs">
    {refs.map(([f,label,href,source])=><figure><img src={p+f} alt={label} width="780" height="580" loading="lazy" /><figcaption><strong>Original reference-based rendering.</strong> {label} <a href={href}>{source} (original)</a>.</figcaption></figure>)}
   </div>
   <div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Value</th><th>Source / role</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <tr><td>Closed enclosure W × H × D</td><td>910 × 1,650 × 795 mm</td><td><a href={brochure+'#page=2'}>LPKF flyer p. 2</a>. Total envelope only; window, hood outline, relief and rear details are inferred.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Exterior configuration</td><td>Closed stationary housing; no external accessories</td><td><a href={photo}>LPKF photograph</a> and flyer p. 1; opaque tinted representation, no internal hardware.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Chart coordinate scale</td><td>0.25 mm/pixel, 54 × 36 pixels</td><td><a href={p+'chart-pair.json'}>Authorial synthetic fixture</a>; not tool accuracy, resolution or operating data.</td></tr>
   </tbody></table></div>
  </section>
  <section>
   <h2>What the comparison means</h2>
   <p>Each fixed chart stores the leading blank length, ink run and trailing blank length on every row. Width is the integer ink-run length multiplied by 0.25 synthetic mm/pixel. Rows are zero-based from the top. A row with no ink has no width, not a zero-length measured feature. Switching displays never edits either chart. The JSON export retains both source IDs, the active display, row, widths, difference and fixture revision.</p>
   <p><strong>Limits:</strong> no laser action, layout or path transfer, fabrication or sample processing. There is no kerf or heat model; thermal width is explicitly not applicable. This metric GLB has a named read-only target for future VR integration; headset operation has not been verified.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
   <h2>Focused verification</h2>
   <div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Test</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Tolerance</th><th>Result</th></tr></thead><tbody>{checks.map(([name,x,y,t])=><tr><td>{name}</td><td>{x}</td><td>{y}</td><td>{t}</td><td>Pass</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
   <p><a href={p+'verification.json'}>Verification results</a> · <a href={p+'contract.json'}>Input/output contract</a> · <a href={p+'example-comparison.json'}>Example comparison</a> · <a href={p+'chart-pair.json'}>Fixed chart pair</a> · <a href={p+'build-fixture.py'}>Chart source</a></p>
   <p><a href={p+'build-model.py'}>Editable Blender source</a> · <a href={p+'protolaser-r4.glb'} download>Download metric GLB</a> · <a href={p+'interaction.json'}>Interaction manifest</a> · <a href={p+'asset-metrics.json'}>GLB metrics</a></p>
  </section>
 </main>
</Layout>
<script>
import '../../../../lib/equipment/04-10/client.mjs';
</script>
<style>
main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:1.2rem clamp(.9rem,2.5vw,2rem) 3rem}
.series,.readout,table,input,select,button{font-family:var(--font-label,system-ui,sans-serif)}
.series{font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.13em}.lead{max-width:72ch}
.duo,.refs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem;margin:1.2rem 0}
.card{border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 30%,transparent);padding:1rem;border-radius:.25rem}
.viewer{height:clamp(23rem,45vw,32rem);overflow:hidden;background:#263949}
.viewer :global(canvas){display:block;width:100%;height:100%;touch-action:none}
#r4-raster{display:block;width:min(100%,26rem);height:auto;background:#263949;margin:.5rem auto 1rem}
.actions,.inputs{display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:.6rem 0}
button,input,select{background:transparent;color:inherit;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 50%,transparent);border-radius:.2rem;padding:.5rem;font-size:.91rem;min-height:2.6rem}
button{cursor:pointer}button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}input{width:min(18rem,55vw)}label{display:grid;font-size:.86rem;gap:.25rem}
figure{margin:0}figure img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}figcaption{font-size:.92rem;margin:.45rem 0}
section{margin:1.5rem 0}.duo section{margin:0}
.tablewrap{overflow:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.88rem}td,th{border-bottom:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 25%,transparent);text-align:left;padding:.5rem;vertical-align:top}
[data-error=true]{font-weight:bold;color:var(--accent,currentColor)}
@media(max-width:770px){.duo,.refs{grid-template-columns:1fr}.viewer{height:22rem}}
</style>
